Root cause:
The bug was caused by the `MemoryIndex.toString()` method potentially throwing a NullPointerException (NPE) when trying to access or manipulate data that was not properly initialized or was null. The renaming of the method to `toStringDebug()` and the updates made to it were intended to ensure that it handles these cases correctly, particularly in managing payload data.

